        "title": "Why It Works"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h5",
      "text": "Fewer blind spots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "One taxonomy from cockpit to office means no translation loss between what a driver saw and what an engineer reviews — the pattern autofleet’s safety-driver app and disengagement metrics point at."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h5",
      "text": "Faster triage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Severity and subsystem are tagged at the moment of the event, not reconstructed later — the edge-case and video-snippet tagging digitaldividedata builds for AV footage retrieval."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h5",
      "text": "Provable ODD coverage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Day/night/rain/traffic pass tracking against campaign targets makes exposure auditable, not anecdotal — operational exposure analysis and compliance/audit automation, both flagged across the research."
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "Approach & Process"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "End-to-End Ownership"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Owned end-to-end design for Fleet Co-Pilot, spanning the cockpit HUD, the incident taxonomy, and the office review dashboard that shares it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Dot Slider",
      "controls": {
