    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "1-Tap Incident Tagging"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Sub-second logging, zero forms"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Phantom Brake, Planner Freeze, Sensor Drop: three quick-tag buttons that log a subsystem and severity the instant something feels off, without pulling a driver’s eyes off the road.\nThe same pattern autofleet’s research flags as essential for safety-driver apps: incident reporting has to be faster than the incident."
    },
