    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "SEV2 · Hesitation"
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "Live Telemetry"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Everything a safety driver sees, structured"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Autonomy state, jerk, lateral g, time-to-collision, and headway gap sit next to the driver-monitoring read: gaze, drowsiness score, hands-on-wheel, and takeover reaction latency.\nNothing here is inferred after the fact — it’s the same read the safety driver had, timestamped."
    },
