        "title": "Hazard Route Intelligence"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Every disengagement becomes a place on the map"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Fault and disengagement hotspots are geotagged with road segment, heading, and prior-disengagement count, then surfaced as an upcoming-hazard countdown as the vehicle approaches them again.\nA tunnel that lost GPS once is a place the whole fleet gets warned about next time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "ODD Coverage & Ingestion"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Provable exposure, not anecdotal"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Day, night, rain/wet, and dense-traffic passes track against a per-route campaign target, so ODD coverage is a number, not a feeling.\nWrite rate, storage used, and sensor-stream sync status ride alongside it, so nothing gets logged in the cockpit and lost before it reaches the office."
    },
